The Geometry Color, Geometry Variable, Geometry Bitmap and Geometry CFF2
font fixtures and their generating
source (tools/generate_typography_fonts.py) are original geometric test data.
No glyph outlines were copied from an existing font.

To the extent possible under law, the authors have waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to these fixtures under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

You may copy, modify, distribute and use them for any purpose, without
permission or attribution. The fixtures are provided without any warranty.
